true},"publishers":["Fortell Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Kekerasan","rating":"13","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"13","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"25 Sep, 2017"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cBlocksWorld HD is more toy than it is game, but it can be entertaining to mess around with.\u201d<br />\r\n80 \u2013 148apps<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cSharing your creations, learning from creations you download, telling stories with them, and recruiting help from others to augment your skill set can create a powerful community.\u201d<br />\r\nGeek Dad<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cBlocksworld might not be a game, but it\u2019s a tool with which you could build a game, if such was your desire. Likewise you could build a walking robot, an army of wobbling men, cars and planes that often crash and just about anything else you can put together out of a handful of pieces and a headful of dreams.\u201d<br />\r\nKotaku<br />\r\n","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642390/ss_06cf0d5610c3c0c0187a5e7d290c7f18f1c305cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760289724","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642390/ss_06cf0d5610c3c0c0187a5e7d290c7f18f1c305cb.600x338.jpg?t=1760289724"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642390/ss_3ef8a420d371fa457a5fd67e201395da09290637.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760289724","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/642390/ss_3ef8a420d371fa457a5fd67e201395da09290637.600x338.jpg?t=1760289724"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c